angelog\r\n### Features\r\n* ef3823182c1a8f1026c21a92598af7c49fddfd55 feature: ergonomic keybinds and mouse support (#110)\r\n* be72933d39536f886d0b1757bf6a6b95246641e8 Themes as files: 12 built-ins and an in-app theme picker (#129)\r\n* d1afb47f2e96582ecf5f3c25f8739e5f6b5dbf26 feat(ui): tiled workspaces and multi-chat pane flow (#112)\r\n* 509ff9e1d4c565577495e800dda0fb57f90d0639 feat(chat): complete the moderator command surface (#120) (#124)\r\n* 776e6a2e9b2bb36454b6a1b2da9776205f123cb1 feat(chat): quote the message a reply answers above it (#117)\r\n* ae27ae266d0a7fbd4ebd4776a9d4adca530cf320 feat(chat): show a badge for messages that arrive while you are scrolled up (#116)\r\n* 25940849b1ed16ad6b52ec0c0769c03f33f746cd feat(chat): show predictions and channel point redemptions (#123)\r\n* 5dc1a57b9a036514a6d8f148841b45bdf2e32398 feat: show emote name tooltip on hover (#113)\r\n* 6adb7f4436e4abf46436287873916d707e4ea3e0 feat(chat): take timeout durations the way Twitch chat does (#118)\r\n* 5e79052acef062c488adf6907ef26219d8435e39 feat(moderation): add unban request queue (#122) (#125)\r\n### Bug fixes\r\n* c21ad9783088f08892b50b5f18120c89a4421249 fix(graphics): transmit animation frames from file, not temp file (#130)\r\n* 1034428c0ac31789cb51238013fda6ceea5044b7 fix screen crop\r\n### Misc\r\n* 479451adaf63b519453f5524b66c71ea664ab5f4 feat(graphics): reach iTerm2 and tmux with graphic emotes (#127)\r\n* 616b197aa5da2c1039cae21dab31dae8f329a02c feat(ui): split panes like i3 containers and centre the pane picker (#126)\r\n* c368e8f78e0236683ed16af796e24ebb9d6c7d1e misc: update deps & caddy (#132)\r\n* e39bd3ecf4e9e59c98b036c127f8f1fa92e5fdef perf(ui): make workspace restore cheap and keep chat rendering robust (#114)\r\n* d1c0de0d60f1efaa52454c3dabe82c1262081b76 perf(ui): stop the render loop and compose the tiled layout as text (#115)\r\n* 32e32240c678a76ff1e43e12cb9f2a41640f70ef refactor(chat): deepen transcript, live events and composer (#128)\r\n* dca86892b76595cbd145e12ada8f239131be49c3 refactor(json): migrate to encoding/json/v2 and drop code generation (#131)\r\n* dcbbab48af114d32cd1d16a6f4a717ecdb57aa4d refactor(ui): give tab state, routing and mode transitions a single owner (#111)\r\n\r\n"}
